                                                "sense_id": "8a4cab7b-e0ad-3b57-87dc-479905b33a4c",
                                                "text": "My son is now a junior at another, bigger school; but our hopes for his schooling have really remained the same. Of course, we want him to be able to read and keep up at maths but the fact that he is still so enthusiastic about his school and his teacher and his classmates"
